            "text": "<p>Tucked away from the noise of everyday life, our studio is designed to help you relax the moment you walk in. Every session is tailored to your body's needs — whether you're easing chronic tension, recovering from an injury, or simply making time to care for yourself.</p><p>Our licensed therapists bring years of training in a range of modalities, so you always leave feeling lighter than when you arrived.</p>",
